---
// ArchitectureFlow.astro - GLASTOR® Core 5-Stage DevSecOps Pipeline
---

<section id="pipeline" class="py-24 bg-cyber-dark relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyber-emerald/10 border border-cyber-emerald/30 text-cyber-emerald text-xs font-mono mb-4">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">schema</span>
        <span>ECOSYSTEM SYNERGY</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-black text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Continuous Zero-Trust Verification Pipeline
      </h2>
      <p class="font-sans text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-lg">
        Specter operates as the Stage 3 Gatekeeper in the complete GLASTOR® Core DevSecOps architecture, bridging pre-build AST test sharding and post-build SIMD binary inspection.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Pipeline Visual Image -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-cyber-border bg-cyber-card/80 p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl mb-12">
      <img
        src="/images/pipeline.svg"
        alt="GLASTOR® Core — Continuous Zero-Trust Verification & Edge Delivery Pipeline"
        class="w-full h-auto rounded-lg"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- 5 Stage Cards Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4">
      <!-- Stage 1 -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyber-card/60 border border-cyber-border/70 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-1">Stage 01</div>
        <div class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Nemesis</div>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400">SAST Governance, secret leaks, and security compliance policies.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 2 -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyber-card/60 border border-cyber-border/70 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-1">Stage 02</div>
        <div class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Vortex</div>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400">Pre-build AST dependency trees and hyper-fast test sharding.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 3 (Highlighted) -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyber-indigo/15 border-2 border-cyber-cyan shadow-lg shadow-cyber-cyan/10 transition-all">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-cyber-cyan font-bold mb-1">
          <span>Stage 03</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">shield</span>
        </div>
        <div class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Specter</div>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-300">Public API contract differ, Trojan breaking-change detection & SemVer gate.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 4 -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyber-card/60 border border-cyber-border/70 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-1">Stage 04</div>
        <div class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Byte-Gauge</div>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400">Post-build SIMD binary inspection, section bloat, and compiler audits.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Stage 5 -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-cyber-card/60 border border-cyber-border/70 hover:border-slate-500 transition-colors">
        <div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 mb-1">Stage 05</div>
        <div class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Medusa</div>
        <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400">Zero-Trust edge gateway, MTLS, and runtime micro-perimeter defense.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
